  <tr> 
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="278"> 
      <big>Scheduling of reservable raids</big> <br>
    </td>
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="267"> 
      <big>March 11, 2002</big> <br>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr colspan="2"> 
    <td class="text" Valign="top" colspan="2"><br>
      Reservable raids (Hate, Fear, Dragons, etc.) Are only to be signed up for by Sr. Officers or other designated raid leaders. If you sign up for a raid as a guild member we cannot sign up for another ourselves. Also as a member of FoV you represent us and if the raid goes poorly then FoV reputation will be tarnished. 
      <hr>
      <br>
    </td>
  </tr>
  
  <tr> 
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="278"> 
      <big>Testing</big> <br>
    </td>
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="267"> 
      <big>March 07, 2002</big> <br>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr colspan="2"> 
    <td class="text" Valign="top" colspan="2"><br>
      This is just a test of the add news form in the officers section. If you see this then any officer can add news to the front page. Just remember I have it set to only display the last 6 news items. 
      <hr>
      <br>
    </td>
  </tr>
  
  <tr> 
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="278"> 
      <big>Artwork needed</big> <br>
    </td>
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="267"> 
      <big>March 07, 2002</big> <br>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr colspan="2"> 
    <td class="text" Valign="top" colspan="2"><br>
      I am going to be adding an artwork section shortly for all of the aspiring artists we have. Whether it is a had drawn and scanned pic, graphic, or even flash movie send it in. 
      <hr>
      <br>
    </td>
  </tr>
  
  <tr> 
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="278"> 
      <big>Web Site Update</big> <br>
    </td>
    <td class="text" valign="top" width="267"> 
      <big>March 07, 2002</big> <br>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr colspan="2"> 
    <td class="text" Valign="top" colspan="2"><br>
      fixed the Database today. Hopefully all the bugs are worked out. Also added the add new member form to the officers only section. Any officer which invites a new member is required to add them to the databse. This is your duty as an officer, if you don’t want to do it don’t be one. 
      <hr>
      <br>
